{"headword":"גָּוַע","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. expire, perish, die (</strong>cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَاعَ</span> <em>be empty, hungry</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:29\" href=\"/Numbers.20.29\">Nu 20:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:20\" href=\"/Joshua.22.20\">Jos 22:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוָ֑עוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:19\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.19\">La 1:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוַעְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:27\" href=\"/Numbers.17.27\">Nu 17:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:3\" href=\"/Numbers.20.3\">20:3</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:15\" href=\"/Job.34.15\">Jb 34:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוָ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:17\" href=\"/Genesis.6.17\">Gn 6:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוְעוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:12\" href=\"/Job.36.12\">Jb 36:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוָ֑עוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.8\">Zc 13:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְוָע֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:29\" href=\"/Psalms.104.29\">ψ 104:29</a> etc.; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:3\" href=\"/Numbers.20.3\">Nu 20:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוֹעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:28\" href=\"/Numbers.17.28\">Nu 17:28</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּוֵעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:16\" href=\"/Psalms.88.16\">ψ 88:16</a>;—<em>expire</em> and die, only P & poet.; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ וימת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:8\" href=\"/Genesis.25.8\">Gn 25:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:17\" href=\"/Genesis.25.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:29\" href=\"/Genesis.35.29\">35:29</a> (all P); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מות</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:11\" href=\"/Job.3.11\">Jb 3:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:10\" href=\"/Job.14.10\">14:10</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:28\" href=\"/Numbers.17.28\">Nu 17:28</a